      "side": 1,
      "message": "if `CONFIG_GERALT_LID_DETECTION_SELECTED` enabled, base detection will keep running in G3, is this intended?\n\n(as a result, the device will enable `en_ppvar_base_x` in G3 when keyboard attached)",
      "range": {
